---
import { getRelativeLocaleUrl } from 'astro:i18n';
import logo from '../assets/images/logo.png';

const locale = Astro.currentLocale ?? 'ko';
// 푸터 "개인정보처리방침" = 웹사이트용(/ko/privacy). 앱용은 별도 문서라 라벨에 "앱"을 붙여 구분한다.
// /terms · /privacy 는 앱에서 넘어오는 기존 정적 페이지다(다른 프로젝트가 서빙).
// 언어 접두사를 붙이면 안 된다 — 앱에도 이 주소가 하드코딩돼 있다.
---

<footer class="site">
  <div class="footer-top">
    <div class="footer-brandrow">
      <div class="footer-brand"><img src={logo.src} alt="" />파킨온</div>
      <div class="footer-lang">
        <button type="button" id="langBtn" aria-haspopup="listbox" aria-expanded="false">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"
            ><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line><path
              d="M12 2a15 15 0 0 1 0 20a15 15 0 0 1 0-20"></path></svg
          >
          한국어
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4>바로가기</h4>
      <a href={getRelativeLocaleUrl(locale, 'news')}>파킨온 소식</a>
      <a href={getRelativeLocaleUrl(locale, 'lifestyle')}>생활 요령</a>
      <a href={getRelativeLocaleUrl(locale, 'institutions')}>제도·지원</a>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4>고객지원</h4>
      <a href={getRelativeLocaleUrl(locale, 'privacy')}>개인정보처리방침</a>
      <a href="/terms">앱 이용약관</a>
      <a href="/privacy">앱 개인정보처리방침</a>
      <a href="mailto:admin@ourmine.co.kr">문의하기</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <div class="footer-legal">
      <p>본 사이트의 정보는 의학적 자문을 대체하지 않습니다. 모든 의학적 결정은 반드시 전문의와 상의하시기 바랍니다.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-divider"></div>
    <button type="button" class="biz-toggle" id="bizToggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="bizInfo">
      <span class="company">주식회사 아워마인</span>
      <span>사업자 정보</span>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
    </button>
    <div class="biz-info" id="bizInfo">
      <p><span class="k">대표</span> 한민석, 최성철 · <span class="k">사업자등록번호</span> 342-81-04379</p>
      <p><span class="k">통신판매업신고</span> 제2026-서울강동-1129호</p>
      <p><span class="k">주소</span> 서울특별시 강동구 양재대로85길 23, E&J빌딩 4층 4590호(성내동)</p>
      <p><span class="k">고객센터</span> 070-4513-1894 · <span class="k">이메일</span> admin@ourmine.co.kr</p>
    </div>
    <p class="footer-copyright">© 2026 OURMINE. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  footer.site {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--outline);
    margin-top: 36px;
    background: var(--surface-low);
  }
  .footer-top {
    padding: 22px var(--gutter) 6px;
    max-width: var(--max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .footer-top {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      text-align: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }
  }
  .footer-brandrow {
    position: relative;
  }
  .footer-brand {
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .footer-brand {
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
  }
  .footer-brand img {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    display: block;
  }
  .footer-lang {
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .footer-lang button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--text-sub);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .footer-lang button:hover {
    color: var(--primary);
  }
  .footer-lang svg {
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .footer-brandrow {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 28px;
    }
    .footer-lang {
      position: absolute;
      right: 0;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
      margin-top: 0;
    }
  }
  .footer-col h4 {
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
  }
  .footer-col a {
    display: block;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: var(--text-sub);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .footer-col a:hover {
    color: var(--primary);
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .footer-col {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px 16px;
    }
    .footer-col h4 {
      display: none;
    }
    .footer-col a {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
  }
  .footer-bottom {
    padding: 6px var(--gutter) 14px;
    max-width: var(--max);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .footer-divider {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--outline);
    margin: 10px 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .footer-bottom {
      text-align: center;
    }
    .biz-toggle {
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
  }
  .footer-legal {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-sub);
    opacity: 0.75;
  }
  .biz-toggle {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--text-sub);
  }
  .biz-toggle:hover {
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .biz-toggle .company {
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .biz-toggle svg {
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  .biz-toggle[aria-expanded='true'] svg {
    transform: rotate(180deg);
  }
  .biz-info {
    overflow: hidden;
    max-height: 0;
    transition: max-height 0.2s ease;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-sub);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .biz-info.open {
    max-height: 200px;
  }
  .biz-info p {
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .biz-info .k {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .footer-copyright {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--text-sub);
    opacity: 0.75;
  }
</style>

<script>
  const bizToggle = document.getElementById('bizToggle')!;
  const bizInfo = document.getElementById('bizInfo')!;
  bizToggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const open = bizInfo.classList.toggle('open');
    bizToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', open ? 'true' : 'false');
  });
</script>
